00:02:48.319 --> 00:02:51.920
okay so let's start

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.640
i was a little late for my shift again

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.599
not that anyone inside was tracking time

00:02:57.599 --> 00:03:00.000
given the town clock was only was the

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.159
only means of tracking it

00:03:02.159 --> 00:03:04.319
i walked into the leaking lizard to see

00:03:04.319 --> 00:03:06.480
the usual morning breakfasts being

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:07.599
served

00:03:07.599 --> 00:03:11.599
and my employee a serving wench elf by

00:03:11.599 --> 00:03:13.599
the name of lessa

00:03:13.599 --> 00:03:15.680
she was threatening to beat the coppers

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.720
out of trintool

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:19.519
or blacksmith who was always fast to

00:03:19.519 --> 00:03:20.000
demand

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.879
payment and all too slow to pay his own

00:03:22.879 --> 00:03:24.560
debts

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:27.760
lessa wasn't some high born snooty elf

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:29.760
she had been raised in a city orphanage

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:30.879
before joining the town

00:03:30.879 --> 00:03:34.159
watch she had more in common with an orc

00:03:34.159 --> 00:03:38.159
berserker than most would expect

00:03:38.159 --> 00:03:40.959
sweetheart you know i'm good for it how

00:03:40.959 --> 00:03:42.319
about tomorrow

00:03:42.319 --> 00:03:45.360
trentil was abruptly cut off

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:47.360
cough up the coppers or you'll be added

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:49.840
to the soup of the day after i shave you

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:53.599
lessa shouted the dwarf staggered

00:03:53.599 --> 00:03:55.120
backwards in fear

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:58.560
suddenly fumbling for his coin purse

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.519
now there's no need to use the s word i

00:04:01.519 --> 00:04:04.080
was just trying to save coin is all

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:06.159
he said half defensively and half

00:04:06.159 --> 00:04:08.000
pleading like a scared child

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.000
everyone knew lessa had cut a dwarf

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.280
speared before

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:13.200
in fact it was rumored she kept it as a

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:17.919
trophy somewhere

00:04:17.919 --> 00:04:20.639
the day was nice and steady now that it

00:04:20.639 --> 00:04:22.400
was tourist season again

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.560
new customers that might become regulars

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.320
had started coming in

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.160
there was always competition among the

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:30.479
ends to get the richest idiots coming

00:04:30.479 --> 00:04:31.919
back for more

00:04:31.919 --> 00:04:34.160
but i needed energy for the night so i

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:36.479
went to lay down for a while

00:04:36.479 --> 00:04:39.520
friday night shifts were always busy but

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.280
rumors had been circulating of

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.639
adventurers coming through

00:04:42.639 --> 00:04:45.280
soon their kind were always throwing

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.720
around gold like it was

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.680
made of bronze but it came at a price

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:53.120
they were often reckless morons too

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:56.080
i had a good nap i woke up to the sound

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.160
of music downstairs though

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:00.960
some band had set up on her stage it

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:03.039
wasn't the worst music ever but it was a

00:05:03.039 --> 00:05:04.639
bit chaotic

00:05:04.639 --> 00:05:07.199
something about bricks and walls didn't

00:05:07.199 --> 00:05:08.880
pay it much mind

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:10.720
we're always happy to offer free drinks

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:12.160
to entertainers if they keep the

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.800
customers happy

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.440
it was night now the place was pretty

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:19.120
packed and a lot of our rooms had been

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.560
booked

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:23.199
i had to help a man up to a room he was

00:05:23.199 --> 00:05:26.160
a halfling so it wasn't much bother

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:28.400
he hadn't paid for a room but he'd been

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.320
tipping well all night

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:31.680
i didn't want to see him out on the

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:34.000
streets this late while so drunk by

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.280
himself

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:38.240
i just tucked him in when kita my night

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.360
shift bar wench

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.000
came bounding down the stairs the tabaxi

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.759
woman told me the thing no one

00:05:43.759 --> 00:05:45.680
would ever truly be ready for in their

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:46.960
humble inn

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:50.560
adventurers are coming we both scrambled

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:52.479
like lunatics and the bar patrons were

00:05:52.479 --> 00:05:54.160
fumbling about too

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:56.319
we got out the emergency shatterproof

00:05:56.319 --> 00:05:57.280
glassware

00:05:57.280 --> 00:05:58.560
the stools that wouldn't go through

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.800
windows replaced our curtains with

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:02.400
fireproof ones

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:04.000
took down all the boards mentioning

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.440
prices

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:07.840
when we then went over our back stories

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.440
just in case someone got questioned too

00:06:09.440 --> 00:06:10.479
much

00:06:10.479 --> 00:06:12.319
i could see some of the patrons already

00:06:12.319 --> 00:06:14.720
panicking they'd forgotten their scripts

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:16.560
at home but it was too late as the door

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.639
began to open

00:06:18.639 --> 00:06:21.199
a mountainous man covered in tattoos

00:06:21.199 --> 00:06:21.919
hair

00:06:21.919 --> 00:06:24.160
and enough wolf fur to traumatize animal

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.960
rights activists walked in first

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:29.919
hello hello what's going on here then

00:06:29.919 --> 00:06:31.680
the stench of devil's weed was pretty

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:33.199
strong on him

00:06:33.199 --> 00:06:35.440
at his feet a little gnome popped in

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:36.400
before

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:39.759
a wood elf pushed past them both drink

00:06:39.759 --> 00:06:41.360
she screamed aloud to no one in

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.840
particular she locked eyes with me

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.600
suddenly like a predator that had found

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.120
its prey

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:51.039
alcohol i moved as fast as i could

00:06:51.039 --> 00:06:54.160
she looked like a ranger maybe a druid

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.400
i'd never seen a customer move so fast

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.639
towards me for a simple ale

00:06:58.639 --> 00:07:00.240
she had taken it from me before i could

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:02.000
even name a price

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:05.840
how rude i thought while simply smiling

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:08.800
ma'am that'll be one silver i said

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.800
trying to appear calm

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.720
she threw a gold coin on the table and

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:15.199
motioned to our whiskey section

00:07:15.199 --> 00:07:17.039
i glimpsed a brown and white to backseat

00:07:17.039 --> 00:07:19.039
woman wearing armor that seemed heavier

00:07:19.039 --> 00:07:20.400
than she was

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.639
she seemed to be moving table to table

00:07:22.639 --> 00:07:24.639
abandoning conversations as of looking

00:07:24.639 --> 00:07:26.960
for some specific information

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.960
most people seemed confused or annoyed

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.880
by her but there are a few laughs and

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.479
smiles

00:07:32.479 --> 00:07:34.960
the muscle one was at the bar now his

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:36.960
accent reminded me of sheep herders from

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:38.880
the southwest

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:40.960
do they have beer he pondered aloud

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:42.880
while staring straight at me

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:46.319
i was sure he was talking to me but

00:07:46.319 --> 00:07:49.120
i want fish the tabaxi yelled excitedly

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:50.479
from among the tables

00:07:50.479 --> 00:07:52.479
suddenly appearing again rushing to the

00:07:52.479 --> 00:07:53.759
bar

00:07:53.759 --> 00:07:57.120
they should have beer right at this

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.479
point i was a little annoyed at them

00:07:58.479 --> 00:08:00.960
