00:08:05.599 --> 00:08:08.160
i said with a strained smile but the

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:10.400
tabaxi woman's eyes lit up

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.720
it's one gold a mug or five gold for a

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.319
