00:08:14.319 --> 00:08:16.560
of course this was a lie it was five

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.240
silver a mug and three gold for a

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.440
pitcher

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:22.160
but it was a tourist season so i could

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:25.039
