00:08:31.199 --> 00:08:34.320
my smile was no longer strained ah thank

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:35.279
you for the tip

00:08:35.279 --> 00:08:37.360
such generous patrons will surely be

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.760
looking for good rooms for the night

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.880
a room just one we like to share the

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.200
tavaxie said as i poured the picture

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:48.399
she announced it to me quite proudly the

00:08:48.399 --> 00:08:49.200
small gnome

