appeared in my vision with her hand up i

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.240
would like a separate room please

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.240
i convinced them to take the lily suite

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.760
which was normally reserved for more

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.200
refined guests

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:01.120
but they seemed to be able to afford it

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:02.959
all things considered

00:09:02.959 --> 00:09:05.839
i wondered what could possibly go wrong

00:09:05.839 --> 00:09:07.680
they were a bit odd but otherwise

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:14.080
fine i thought oh how wrong i was

