00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:38.320
the corner with a small barrel of ale

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:39.360
she'd bought

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:40.880
she was holding it like a valued

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.399
treasure

