00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:54.320
and prodding the orc with a clawed

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.519
finger

00:09:55.519 --> 00:09:57.040
before you could say praise the dark

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:58.720
lord the orc had

